  <dcat:Dataset rdf:about="https://www.climatecentre.be/dataset/22dc62f0-ca7f-11ee-9a71-847b573ec00f">
    <dct:title>Climate projections for Belgium</dct:title>
    <dct:description>The climate projections for Belgium are available as different data types: 1/ Daily climate model simulations and projections at a high spatial resolution of 0.025 degrees or 2.8km for 3 Regional Climate Models. 2/ Climate indicators for a present and future target year.</dct:description>
